# The seeds of the compiler: released executables of stage1/ailc.ai for
# x86-64 Linux, one a line, the last line the one the build is pinned to.
#
#   version revision sha256 url
#
# version   number of the seed; the release is tagged seed-<version> and
#           the file is named ailc-<version>
# revision  the commit whose stage1/ailc.ai and stage1/tables.ai it was
#           built from; built again from that source by itself it gives
#           the same file
# sha256    of the file; a copy with another checksum is refused
# url       where the release keeps it
#
# A local copy is seed/ailc-<version>, which git ignores. Earlier lines
# stay, so that an older revision can still be built with its own seed.
